{"id":"5052","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5052_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这些规则排列的云元素是高积云，因为它们在臂长处的表观宽度为1到3个手指。它们属于成层状云云种（它们分布在广泛的水平层）和透光云云类（它们是透明的足以显示太阳的位置）和漏隙云（在元素之间有明显的空间）。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚维多利亚州Aspendale Gardens","latitude":"纬度: 38° 1' 51'' S","longitude":"经度: 145° 7' 26'' E","date":"10 November 2016 1919 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.8","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.8"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5052_syn_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>一个较弱的高压系统和脊线主导了这个地区。高积云形成于中层弱高层槽之前。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 2016年，澳大利亚联邦气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5052_sat_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus_clouds.jpeg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>增强的红外卫星图像显示，云顶面积范围为-10°C至-20°C（距离附近的高空探测4200至5600米（14000至18500 ft））。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 2016年，澳大利亚联邦气象局/日本气象厅","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5168_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-undulatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>照片上三分之二部分<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">相对较小的白色云素</span>确定为高积云。这些云素形成了大范围的云片（成层云种）。可为这一识别增加以下云类：透光（云素足够透光，可显露出太阳的位置）、漏隙（云素间的小空隙可露出蓝天）以及波状（单独的云素大致以平行线排列）。</p>\n<p>高积云和一些更高的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷状云</span>在弱暖锋的前方向东推进（图片左侧）。还可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎积云</span>的痕迹（右上方浅灰色）以及向地平线延伸的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">深灰色层积云</span>（图片下部）。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"根西岛附近","latitude":"纬度: 49° 23' 43'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 28' 13'' W","date":"02 August 2008 2012 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 8, CM= 3, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.8","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.8"}]}]}